{"id":123,"slug":"hoodwink","name":"森海飞霞","en":"Hoodwink","aliases":["松鼠","hood"],"attr":"agi","attrLabel":"敏捷","attack":"远程","roles":["辅助","爆发","逃生","控制"],"positions":[4],"positionLabels":["4 号位"],"positionNames":["软辅 / 游走"],"lanes":["游走"],"complexity":2,"complexityLabel":"中等","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/hoodwink.png","art":"assets/heroes/art/hoodwink.jpg","card":"assets/heroes/cards/hoodwink.png","winrate":47.05,"pickrate":10.88,"trend":[46.94,46.8,47.3,47.24,47.19,46.83,47.36],"delta":0.42,"pubPick":417372,"pubWin":196368,"proPick":51,"proWin":23,"proBan":34,"lore":"在云硝国的边界，绿色的森林绵延不绝，生活悠然自得，森海飞霞的早年时光就是在这里度过的。但是随着王国的发展，居民和军队的需求急剧增加，互相竞争的矿石和木材大亨拼命地你追我赶，疯狂地进行扩张来满足日新月异的需求，而边界森林的自然美景不断遭到蚕食。 \n\n生活在古老林地中的人们别无选择，摆在面前的选择有跟随一众难民进入和平地带，或者在保卫自己的房屋时倒在云硝国的火药和铁器之下，又或者继续北上，逃往云雾缭绕的托莫干森林，在幽谷和密林中碰碰运气。\n\n而正是在这片危险的北方林渊中，森海飞霞时刻都在躲避托莫干中可怕的捕食者，拉拢当地一些匪徒时也对其他帮派施以颜色，还会想尽一切办法来引发有意思的恶作剧——听说她常常就是罪魁祸首。就这样，她一路长大成年。\n\n但云硝国的大火终于有一丝气味飘到了她第二个故乡，森海飞霞的思绪落在侵略下存活的亲友身上——如今他们在被夷平的土地上苟延残喘，这让她心如刀割——她禁不住想前往文明的边际，看一眼摧毁她过去生活的恶魔。\n\n到了目的地之后，她亲眼见到了。她看到她童年里的怪物根本就不是怪物。他们只是……普通人。士兵，工人，商贩……还有难民。而士兵，就算配备了火药和铁器，也根本比不上托莫干的危险——那是真正的危险，有着触角和利齿——她像不停转动的枫子围绕着这些危险翩翩起舞。\n\n永远笼罩着浓雾的森林让多数热血的人们不敢涉足，而森海飞霞对其中盘根错节的小路了如指掌，现在她会对胆敢威胁林野的人出手——开心地从他们手里拿走自己喜爱的东西，摧毁她不感兴趣的，还有帮助幸存的同胞重拾森林中的生活。","hype":"麻烦来临时森海飞霞总是身在左近，她的生活就是与自己视为家乡的诡异林渊中充斥的威胁纠缠不清。 携带着巨大的弩机，同时仍能在密林中轻松奔走，森海飞霞在战斗中来去自如。只要有一瞬间没见到她，她就会从你背后现身——而你目瞪口呆的尸体已经挂在她的一张网里。","npe":"将敌人束缚在树上","stats":{"health":472,"healthRegen":1.85,"mana":327,"manaRegen":1.05,"damage":"47–54","armor":3.7,"magicResistance":25,"moveSpeed":315,"attackRange":575,"attackRate":2,"turnRate":0.9,"sightDay":1800,"sightNight":800,"str":{"base":16,"gain":2},"agi":{"base":22,"gain":3.6},"int":{"base":21,"gain":2.9}},"abilities":[{"id":8429,"key":"hoodwink_acorn_shot","name":"爆栗出击","en":"Acorn Shot","desc":"森海飞霞向目标单位发射一颗橡栗，可以弹射至附近敌人，减缓他们的移动速度，并造成攻击伤害的一定百分比和额外伤害。\n可以对地面施放，在目标地点种出一棵树，而橡栗会弹射至附近目标。设为多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）后会强制沿用该行为。","lore":"虽然她几乎什么都能凑合着用，不过橡树和铁树之木的栗子是最有效的炮弹——也是森海飞霞大部分的存货来源。","notes":["同一个目标可以被击中超过一次。","弹射会搜寻525范围内战争迷雾中的单位，但无视隐身单位。","种下的树持续20秒。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"acorn_shot_damage","label":"额外伤害","value":"45 / 90 / 135 / 180"},{"key":"base_damage_pct","label":"基础攻击力","value":"80%"},{"key":"bounce_count","label":"弹射次数","value":"2 / 3 / 4 / 5"},{"key":"debuff_duration","label":"减速持续时间","value":"0.3 秒"},{"key":"slow","label":"移动速度减缓","value":"100%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"19 / 16 / 13 / 10 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"70 / 80 / 90 / 100"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"675 / 700 / 725 / 750"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/hoodwink_acorn_shot.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":8158,"key":"hoodwink_bushwhack","name":"野地奇袭","en":"Bushwhack","desc":"扔出一张网，对区域内靠近树木的敌人造成眩晕。敌人会持续受到伤害并被拖拽到目标区域内最近的树上，并且眩晕期间视野降低至0。","lore":"森海飞霞喜欢利用铁树之木的树丛来伏击，但机警的人在永雾林渊的所有地方都会小心行走。","notes":["若树木被摧毁，被影响的单位将解除眩晕。","野地奇袭不会击中隐身单位。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"trap_radius","label":"作用范围","value":"265"},{"key":"debuff_duration","label":"眩晕时间","value":"1.5 / 1.7 / 1.9 / 2.1 秒"},{"key":"total_damage","label":"总伤害","value":"90 / 180 / 270 / 360"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"15 / 14 / 13 / 12 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"90 / 100 / 110 / 120"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"1100"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/hoodwink_bushwhack.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":9501,"key":"hoodwink_scurry","name":"密林奔走","en":"Scurry","desc":"森海飞霞在短时间内获得移动速度加成，相位移动状态和穿行树木效果。开启时林渊旅人的转向几率为2倍。","lore":"托莫干森林里没有一处角落或者裂缝是森海飞霞的爪子够不着的。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"movement_speed_pct","label":"移动速度加成","value":"15% / 20% / 25% / 30%"},{"key":"duration","label":"加成持续时间","value":"3.5 / 4 / 4.5 / 5 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"魔法","value":"35"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"275"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/hoodwink_scurry.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":8107,"key":"hoodwink_decoy","name":"诱敌奇术","en":"Decoy","desc":"森海飞霞变为隐身，提升移动速度，并且产生一个引诱敌人的幻象，幻象会瞄准最近的敌方英雄开始蓄力准备发射伤害较低的一箭穿心。如果幻象被攻击或被指向性技能击中，幻象将被摧毁并且攻击者将受到较弱的野地奇袭效果。","lore":"最好的陷阱是不论有没有碰到都会触发。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"幻象持续时间","value":"6 秒"},{"key":"decoy_detonate_radius","label":"野地奇袭作用范围","value":"250"},{"key":"decoy_stun_duration","label":"野地奇袭持续时间","value":"1.6 秒"},{"key":"movement_speed","label":"移动速度","value":"15%"},{"key":"sharpshooter_damage_pct","label":"一箭穿心伤害","value":"60%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"30 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"60"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/hoodwink_decoy.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1422,"key":"hoodwink_hunters_boomerang","name":"猎手旋镖","en":"Hunter's Boomerang","desc":"掷出一把沿弧线飞行的回旋镖。击中后会飞回至森海飞霞。回旋镖对沿途击中的敌人都会造成伤害，并且施加一个负面效果，使受到作用的敌人被减速，承受的技能伤害增加。","lore":"森海飞霞童年的宝贵残存变成了致命的消遣。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"radius","label":"作用范围","value":"150"},{"key":"damage","label":"伤害","value":"200"},{"key":"mark_duration","label":"负面状态持续时间","value":"6 秒"},{"key":"slow_pct","label":"移动速度减缓","value":"25%"},{"key":"spell_amp","label":"技能伤害提升","value":"20%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"20 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"125"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"1100"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/hoodwink_hunters_boomerang.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1423,"key":"hoodwink_mistwoods_wayfarer","name":"林渊旅人","en":"Mistwoods Wayfarer","desc":"森海飞霞有几率使敌人的攻击转向至附近的树木。","lore":"","notes":["受到转向攻击的树木会被摧毁。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"radius","label":"树木搜寻范围","value":"275"},{"key":"redirect_chance","label":"转向几率","value":"14.25%"}],"chips":[],"type":"innate","typeLabel":"先天技能","icon":"assets/abilities/hoodwink_mistwoods_wayfarer.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":8106,"key":"hoodwink_sharpshooter","name":"一箭穿心","en":"Sharpshooter","desc":"森海飞霞装载她的弩机，射出致命的一箭，对一名敌方英雄造成高额伤害，并施加破坏和减速效果。伤害和负面状态持续时间随着装载时间增加，3秒后达到最大效果，弩箭在5秒后自动发射。\n由于弩箭的威力，森海飞霞后退350距离。弩箭穿过的非英雄单位会受到半额伤害。","lore":"虽然森海飞霞的第一把弩机是碰巧发现的，但现在她非常精心地雕刻她自己的劲弩，并且做好防护工作 - 当然，某些必要的部件是顺手牵羊得来的，不然就是通过机智的手段获得。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"提升箭矢速度和减速效果。","values":[{"key":"arrow_speed","label":"弩箭速度","value":"2200","scepter":"25"},{"key":"max_charge_time","label":"最大蓄力时间","value":"3 秒"},{"key":"max_damage","label":"最高伤害","value":"600 / 975 / 1350"},{"key":"max_slow_debuff_duration","label":"最长负面状态持续时间","value":"5 秒"},{"key":"slow_move_pct","label":"移动速度减缓","value":"30% / 40% / 50%","scepter":"20%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"45 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"150 / 200 / 250"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"3000"}],"type":"ultimate","typeLabel":"终极技能","icon":"assets/abilities/hoodwink_sharpshooter.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true}],"talents":[{"level":10,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_hoodwink_bushwhack_damage","name":"+50 野地奇袭伤害","en":"+50 Bushwhack Damage"},{"key":"special_bonus_hp_175","name":"+175 生命","en":"+175 Health"}]},{"level":15,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_hoodwink_scurry_charges","name":"+1 密林奔走能量点数","en":"+1 Scurry Ability Charge"},{"key":"special_bonus_agility_10","name":"+10 敏捷","en":"+10 Agility"}]},{"level":20,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_hoodwink_sharpshooter_vision","name":"一箭穿心蓄力期间提供视野","en":"Sharpshooter Provides Vision While Charging"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_hoodwink_acorn_shot_bounces","name":"+2 爆栗出击弹射","en":"+2 Acorn Shot Bounces"}]},{"level":25,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_hoodwink_sharpshooter_damage","name":"+400 一箭穿心最大伤害","en":"+400 Sharpshooter Max Damage"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_hoodwink_acorn_shot_charges","name":"2 爆栗出击能量点数","en":"2 Acorn Shot Charges"}]}],"build":{"start_game_items":[{"slug":"branches","name":"铁树枝干","img":"assets/items/branches.png","cost":55,"count":180,"heat":100},{"slug":"ward_dispenser","name":"侦察·岗哨守卫","img":"assets/items/ward_dispenser.png","cost":50,"count":108,"heat":60},{"slug":"tango","